COMPILATION OF: E48E3

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48E3

   1 a 0000 E48E3:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P2e] a negated condition as a STORE VALUE over the DCX
   4 a 0006      ladder: ^(k = 2).  [C310] pins the value negation ONLY for ^(k
   5 a 0006      = 0), where DR emits the ^=0 bytes ADI FF/SBB A with no ladder
   6 a 0006      at all; the ladder head under `^' has never been sampled. */
   7 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('0'b);
   8 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
   9 c 0006   b = ^(k = 2);
  10 c 0013   put list('B=', b);
  11 c 0035   stop;
  12 a 0038 end E48E3;

CODE SIZE = 0038
DATA AREA = 0005
FREE SYMS = 38AE
END  COMPILATION
